<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00042">
	<title id="e00216">Theft-alarm system </title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>theft-alarm system</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<p>The theft-alarm system provides protection from unauthorized entry into the vehicle.</p>
		<p>This system is operated in 3 stages:</p>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e00217">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e00218">
								<image href="images/OMQ4A035459.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<ol outputclass="callout" id="e00219">
								<li>
									<p>Armed stage</p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p>Disarmed stage</p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p>Theft-alarm stage</p>
								</li>
							</ol>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>If triggered, the system alarm sounds, and the hazard warning lights blink.</p>
	</conbody>
	<related-links>
		<linkpool>
			<link format="dita" href="t00033.dita#t00033" role="parent" scope="local" type="concept">
				<linktext>Opening and Closing</linktext>
			</link>
		</linkpool>
	</related-links>
</concept>